date-released: 2026-04-25
keywords:
  - autonomous-driving
  - transfer-diagnostics
  - WOD-E2E
  - AlpaSim
  - NAVSIM
abstract: >-
  CoRL 2027 repository for AlpaSim transfer diagnostics, WOD-E2E selector
  evidence, and the Spotlight Reflex code used to generate diagnostic
  candidates. Includes an internal 2D debug simulator, a Waymo Open Dataset
  end-to-end candidate/selector stack, and NAVSIM v2 diagnostic tooling.
